OK; there's hell, and there's heaven (level teleport to level -1 while
levitating, but now you don't win).  What about purgatory?  Suppose
you've gotten your god angry, but you haven't changed your alignment
yet.  You find an altar, and make a very nice sacrifice.  Suddenly an
angel appears before you, and offers her hand.  You teleport to a new
set of levels, where you can gain the good graces of your god through
various painful experiences.  For example, you fight a nasty monster
and get reduced to <5 hp.  Regain one point of luck.  You pass through
a nasty maze, and nearly starve.  Regain another point of luck.  When
you get your luck positive again, Beatrice shows up again and returns
you whence you came.

Well?
